  "description": "Comprehensive redevelopment of nos. 24-28 Broadway Market. The application site currently comprises nos. 24-26 Broadway Market (The Dove Freehouse) and no. 28 Broadway Market, a building which forms an extension to the Dove Freehouse at basement and ground floor levels and with a flat above.\n\nThe proposals include the demolition of all existing buildings on the site and the erection of a 3 storey and a half storey, with basement and mansard roof, mixed use building. A pub will be retained at ground floor and basement levels, with residential units on the first, second and third floors.\n\nThe proposals include 9 self contained residential dwellings comprising 5 x 1-bedroom units and 4 x 2-bedroom units.\n\t\n",
  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission"
